==English==
[[Image:Langur at Cheri Goemba.jpg|thumb|Gray langur]]

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|hi}} and {{etyl|ur}} {{term|लंगूर|lang=hi}} / {{term|لنگور|tr=lãṅgūr|lang=ur}}, from {{etyl|sa}} {{term|लाङ्गूलिन्|tr=lāṅgūlin|lang=sa}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Any of the [[Old World]] monkeys of the subfamily [[Colobinae]], in the genera ''[[Simias]]'', ''[[Trachypithecus]]'' ([[lutung]]s), ''[[Presbytis]]'', ([[surili]]s), and ''[[Semnopithecus]]'', ([[gray langur]]s).

